00.056640625], "widgets_values": ["**Global Tags:**\nPop Ballad, Romantic, Dreamy, Acoustic Guitar, Piano, Soft Synth, Mid-tempo, Emotional"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 15, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 26, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio_output", "links": [13], "label": "audio_output", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio_output"}, {"name": "filepath", "label": "filepath", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filepath"}], "size": [589.8372802734375, 832.899169921875], "pos": [1703.4853515625, 1319.6221923828125], "widgets_values": ["[Intro]\n月光在墙角 慢慢地变凉\n药片在手心 像冰冷的糖\n\n[Verse]\n我关掉灯火 关掉所有过往\n让意识 沉入深不见底的海洋\n呼吸声 越来越轻 越来越长\n你的背影 在视网膜里 慢慢发黄\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n我以为 终于能 彻底地遗忘\n不再为 谁的离开 感到心慌\n所有的挣扎 都在这一刻 变得安详\n\n[Chorus]\n可世界 偏要把我 从黑暗中 拖回现场\n冰冷的器械 撕裂了 最后的伪装\n我听见 救护车 划破寂静的 疯狂\n为什么 连绝望 都要被 强行埋葬\n我醒在 刺眼的白光里 满目荒凉\n\n[Verse]\n氧气罩里 雾气 模糊了眼眶\n血管里 冰冷的液体 在静静流淌\n他们说 活着 才有 希望\n可谁能 缝补我 胸口 那个 巨大的 洞穿\n\n[Bridge]\n她走了 她走了 带走了光\n我留着 我留着 守着皮囊\n这重生的 惩罚 如此 漫长\n把破碎的心 再次 钉在 荒野之上\n\n[Instrumental]\n\n[Chorus]\n可世界 偏要把我 从黑暗中 拖回现场\n冰冷的器械 撕裂了 最后的伪装\n我听见 救护车 划破寂静的 疯狂\n为什么 连绝望 都要被 强行埋葬\n我醒在 刺眼的白光里 满目荒凉\n\n[Outro]\n夜晚 还没 结束\n我 却 已经 归来\n只剩 呼吸\n在 空荡的 房间 徘徊                    ", "Melancholic Alt-Pop, Emo Rock, Dark Atmospheric, Piano Ballad, Distorted Electric Guitar, Emotional Male Vocals, Cinematic, Heartbreaking, Slow Tempo, Heavy Reverb", "RL-oss-3B-20260123", "oss-20260123", 1094056715189311, "randomize", 120, 50, 1.0000000000000002, 1.5, true, "auto", false], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "link": 18, "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "link": 17, "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "