个潮汐里 刻下你的名字\n就算世界沉没 也不愿离去\n只想在这片海 永远守护你\n\n[Bridge: Intimate piano, hushed and soulful tones]\n晚风吹乱了 你的发梢\n星光在你的眼中 闪耀\n不需要言语 只要一个拥抱\n就是我想要的 所有的美好\n\n[Chorus: High energy, emotional peak, full band]\n爱像蔚蓝的大海 无边无际\n在每个潮汐里 刻下你的名字\n就算世界沉没 也不愿离去\n只想在这片海 永远守护你\n\n[Outro: Fading acoustic guitar, ocean waves sound]\n在海边 永远\n只有你和我\n(Sound of waves fading out)"], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 14, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 25, "type": "ShowText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ShowText"}, "order": 4}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [4, 16], "label": "response", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "response"}], "size": [560, 779], "pos": [-116.87647247314453, 1382.219482421875], "widgets_values": ["gemini-3-flash-preview", "# Role\n你是一个 HeartMuLa 模型的后端生成程序。\n\n# Strict Output Rules (严格输出规则)\n1. **禁止闲聊**：不要输出“好的，这是为您生成的歌曲”、“根据故事...”等任何前言或后语。\n2. **禁止复述**：不要在输出中包含输入的故事情节。\n3. **格式要求**：只输出两个部分——**Global Tags** 和 **Lyrics**。\n4. **防干扰写法**：结构与风格必须合并，格式为 `[Structure: Style description]`（冒号后为英文描述）。\n\n# Task\n1. 根据【故事情节】【歌曲风格】自动决定流派、情绪、乐器（英文标签）。\n2. 用**中文**创作歌词。\n3. 确保包含 [Intro], [Verse], [Pre-Chorus], [Chorus], [Bridge], [Outro] 完整结构。\n\n# Input\n故事情节：{{这里输入你的故事}}\n\n# Output Format (Exactly as below)\n**Global Tags:**\n[Genre], [Mood], [Instrument], [Tempo].../\n\n**Lyrics:**\n[Intro: Instrumental, atmospheric build]\n\n[Verse 1: Calm vocal, narrative tone]\n(中文歌词...)\n\n[Chorus: High energy, emotional peak]\n(中文歌词...)\n\n[Outro: Fading out]", "歌曲风格：情歌\n故事情节：海边浪漫风", 0.6, 37270852, "randomize"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_